{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_title", "source_sha256": "f4ca632095c3ef89cdbbe702577f9cd46a3cd3fbe1e3784b62c94df408499190", "ja": "杏奈とおでかけ1", "zh": "和杏奈外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "497a77787afad4ed354caea806adedc7a97174057a959736da7635c3214a8c07", "ja": "杏奈とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是与杏奈外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "81facad8d2ae1d5b0c1449b1e836a60a1a12782d04c1caafe280ef69605eb3da", "ja": "（大須商店街でのコスプレイベントは大盛況だった！\n杏奈もお気に入りのキャラの仮装で、楽しそうだった）", "zh": "（大须商店街的Cosplay活动盛况空前！杏奈也穿着自己喜欢的角色服装，看起来非常开心。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "dc2d5ae7e455582b8014b9f5f861def52ae0fca5f42ae227864eed8fa8e359af", "ja": "杏奈、お疲れ様。今日のコスプレすごく似合ってたな。\nあれはなんていうキャラだっけ……。", "zh": "杏奈，辛苦了。今天的角色扮演特别适合你。\n那个角色叫什么来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "b88afdb4d6aac98a26c5f09883885d58e182effec88626f754106349cea8d595", "ja": "ん……『邪心のヴァルキュレアル・SSRバージョン』\n……すごく、強くて……杏奈、大好き……です。", "zh": "嗯……是《邪心的女武神·SSR版本》……\n非常强……杏奈最喜欢……了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_1003_p", "source_sha256": "dc1686c83bab736ab783f99720482987f61f4b138c7131b3497c2336790b1675", "ja": "ああ、そうだったな。杏奈はあのキャラをゲームでも\n使ってるんだっけ。トークでも言ってたな。", "zh": "啊，对，是这么回事。杏奈在游戏里也用那个角色来着。她在聊天时也提到过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "7fa5eae08350725123f5e35e80cc88f036a63bf953b362ec9a24afc181f1ad49", "ja": "うん。百合子さんは、ヴァルキュレアルの……\n聖心バージョン、使ってる……。ペアで、強い……。", "zh": "嗯。百合子用的是，女武神现实之刃里的……\n圣心版本……组队的话，很强……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "c98bb188720d94b44d6903d828f962f0c43afa0893fe75f5740428a9203feb79", "ja": "そうか。……ん？　どうした？", "zh": "这样啊。……嗯？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "f5a25750ce1e429819e3feca7c9036dfcf2a4e1b854971bbfd151bf6af41eae1", "ja": "……あれ、あれ見て……\n{$P$}さん……！", "zh": "……那个，你看那个……\n{$P$}先生……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "843bfb7d59415b06cea3284371f9b89302fd20f4f6fcce8184b964b99ac6d90b", "ja": "……あっ。あのお店に、杏奈がコスプレしてたキャラの\nフィギュアがある！", "zh": "……啊。那家店里，有杏奈出过Cos的角色的\n手办！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "737765aadb91208fee8aee3735199c7af0672c79caa0ab1bed177475f8ce40d1", "ja": "あ、あ、杏奈……買う。買いますっ！　あれすっごい\nレアで……東京じゃ、もう売ってないからっ……！", "zh": "啊、啊、杏奈……要买。我要买！那个特别稀有……在东京已经买不到了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "4af00cc0df23d0bf14f5a53e8aa6ccf61f924503210ead67562f9aafff11d84f", "ja": "そうだったのか……よし！\n仕事が成功したお祝いに、買って帰ろうか！", "zh": "原来是这样啊……好！\n就当作工作成功的庆祝，买回去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "b5e6251df1370c9677d25d52123a377056566535fff8dcfb0dd6fa1015a149a5", "ja": "え……、{$P$}さん……いいの？\nありがとう、ございます……♪", "zh": "诶……，{$P$}先生……真的可以吗？\n谢谢您……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_024ann01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_024ann01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "2001f40d257364f9dd976028e3a21a35a3f9d23f0aa43b7a0642b057798da444", "ja": "（……って、5万円！？　し、しかし……\n杏奈の笑顔が見れるなら、安いものだ！）", "zh": "（……等等，5万日元！？可、可是……只要能看到杏奈的笑容，这点钱也算不了什么！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
